<title>INDIA: Indian rupee ends steady vs dlr in dull trade.</title>
<headline>Indian rupee ends steady vs dlr in dull trade.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rupee closed unchanged at 35.62/63 per dollar on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee has been steady at this level since the weekend.</p>
<p>The forward dollar premia continued to be soft on expectations of easing liquidity in the domestic money market.</p>
<p>&quot;I expect a small revival in forwards,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
